        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Question: Both conditions",
            "id": 95807,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quali elementi vengono selezionati quando si filtra con condizioni concatenate con <code>AND</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Elementi che soddisfano tutte le condizioni</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Elementi che soddisfano una o più condizioni</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Elementi che non soddisfano alcuna condizione</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Elementi che soddisfano tutte le condizioni.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per selezionare una riga, tutte le condizioni unite con <code>AND</code> devono essere vere.</p><p>Un libro supera il primo filtro, ma non il secondo unito con <code>AND</code>. Viene selezionato?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">No, deve soddisfare entrambi i filtri</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sì, è sufficiente che corrisponda un filtro</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Sì, AND ignora il secondo filtro</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">No, deve soddisfare entrambi i filtri.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Comparisons",
            "id": 95812,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi una condizione per filtrare anche gli elementi con un <code>year</code> inferiore a <code>2000</code> usando l'operatore <code>AND</code>.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE books (&#xA; title varchar(255),&#xA; year int,&#xA; genre varchar(255)&#xA;);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO books(title, year, genre)&#xA;VALUES ('Ulysses', 1992, 'fiction');&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO books(title, year, genre)&#xA;VALUES ('Sapiens', 2011, 'non-fiction');&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO books(title, year, genre)&#xA;VALUES ('Beloved', 1987, 'fiction');&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO books(title, year, genre)&#xA;VALUES ('The Prince', 1532, 'non-fiction');\"><tables><table name=\"books\"><row><header content=\"title\" /><header content=\"year\" /><header content=\"genre\" /></row><row><data content=\"Ulysses\" /><data content=\"1992\" /><data content=\"fiction\" /></row><row><data content=\"Sapiens\" /><data content=\"2011\" /><data content=\"non-fiction\" /></row><row><data content=\"Beloved\" /><data content=\"1987\" /><data content=\"fiction\" /></row><row><data content=\"The Prince\" /><data content=\"1532\" /><data content=\"non-fiction\" /></row></table></tables></database><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" books\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" genre = \" /><text value=\"'non-fiction'\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"AND\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" &lt; \" /><text value=\"2000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"64\" /></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><header content=\"title\" /><header content=\"year\" /><header content=\"genre\" /></row><row><data content=\"The Prince\" /><data content=\"1532\" /><data content=\"non-fiction\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>AND year &lt; 2000</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Equivalent to BETWEEN",
            "id": 95810,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo sostituire <code>year &gt; 1800 AND year &lt; 1900</code> con <code>BETWEEN 1800 AND 1900</code>?<br /></p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" books\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" &gt; \" /><text value=\"1800\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"AND\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" &lt; \" /><text value=\"1900\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" ;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">No, per poterlo fare gli operatori dovrebbero essere <code>&gt;=</code> e <code>&lt;=</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sì, le due cose sono equivalenti</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">No, non possiamo usare <code>BETWEEN</code> con i numeri</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">No, per poterlo fare gli operatori dovrebbero essere <code>&gt;=</code> e <code>&lt;=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La query esclude i libri del 1800 e 1900. Quale modifica crea una condizione equivalente a <code>BETWEEN 1800 AND 1900</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" books\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" &gt; \" /><text value=\"1800\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"AND\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" &lt; \" /><text value=\"1900\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" ;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Usare <code>&gt;=</code> e <code>&lt;=</code> nelle due condizioni</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Mantenere <code>&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;</code> perché BETWEEN esclude gli estremi</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Sostituire <code>AND</code> con <code>OR</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Usare <code>&gt;=</code> e <code>&lt;=</code> nelle due condizioni.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: IN, BETWEEN, and LIKE 2",
            "id": 95813,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che tipo di elementi seleziona questa query?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" books\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" title \" /><text value=\"LIKE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'%a%'\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"AND\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"IN\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"2019\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2020\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Elementi con un <code>title</code> contenente <code>a</code> e un <code>year</code> pari a <code>2019</code> o <code>2020</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Elementi con un <code>year</code> pari a <code>2019</code> o <code>2020</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Elementi con un <code>title</code> contenente <code>a</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Elementi con un <code>title</code> contenente <code>a</code> e un <code>year</code> pari a <code>2019</code> o <code>2020</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>LIKE '%a%'</code> corrisponde al testo che contiene <code>a</code>. Ogni <code>%</code> corrisponde a zero o più caratteri.</p><p>Un libro contiene <code>a</code> nel titolo, ma è stato pubblicato nel 2018. La query mostrata lo seleziona?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" books\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" title \" /><text value=\"LIKE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'%a%'\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"AND\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"IN\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"2019\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2020\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">No, il suo anno non è 2019 né 2020</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sì, il suo titolo corrisponde a LIKE</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Sì, LIKE ignora il filtro sull'anno</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">No, il suo anno non è 2019 né 2020.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: IN, BETWEEN, and LIKE",
            "id": 95811,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Collega una condizione che controlli se <code>genre</code> inizia con f, usando il pattern <code>'f%'</code> e l'operatore <code>AND</code>.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE books (&#xA; title varchar(255),&#xA; year int,&#xA; genre varchar(255)&#xA;);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO books(title, year, genre)&#xA;VALUES ('Ulysses', 1992, 'fiction');&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO books(title, year, genre)&#xA;VALUES ('Sapiens', 2011, 'non-fiction');&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO books(title, year, genre)&#xA;VALUES ('Beloved', 1987, 'fiction');&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO books(title, year, genre)&#xA;VALUES ('The Prince', 1532, 'non-fiction');\"><tables><table name=\"books\"><row><header content=\"title\" /><header content=\"year\" /><header content=\"genre\" /></row><row><data content=\"Ulysses\" /><data content=\"1992\" /><data content=\"fiction\" /></row><row><data content=\"Sapiens\" /><data content=\"2011\" /><data content=\"non-fiction\" /></row><row><data content=\"Beloved\" /><data content=\"1987\" /><data content=\"fiction\" /></row><row><data content=\"The Prince\" /><data content=\"1532\" /><data content=\"non-fiction\" /></row></table></tables></database><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" books\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"BETWEEN\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"1900\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"AND\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"2000\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"AND\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" genre \" /><text value=\"LIKE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'f%'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"73\" /></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><header content=\"title\" /><header content=\"year\" /><header content=\"genre\" /></row><row><data content=\"Ulysses\" /><data content=\"1992\" /><data content=\"fiction\" /></row><row><data content=\"Beloved\" /><data content=\"1987\" /><data content=\"fiction\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>AND genre LIKE 'f%'</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: At least one condition",
            "id": 95898,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Questa query seleziona elementi con <code>genre</code> uguale a <code>'non-fiction'</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" books\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" genre = \" /><text value=\"'fiction'\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"OR\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" = \" /><text value=\"2011\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><data content=\"No result!\" /></row></table></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sì, se quegli elementi soddisfano la condizione <code>year = 2011</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">No, perché gli elementi devono soddisfare tutte le condizioni</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Sì, perché la query seleziona tutti gli elementi della tabella</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sì, se quegli elementi soddisfano la condizione <code>year = 2011</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un libro di saggistica è stato pubblicato nel 2011. La query <code>OR</code> mostrata lo seleziona?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" books\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" genre = \" /><text value=\"'fiction'\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"OR\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" = \" /><text value=\"2011\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sì, perché soddisfa <code>year = 2011</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">No, perché il suo genere non è narrativa</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">No, perché devono corrispondere entrambe le condizioni OR</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sì, perché soddisfa <code>year = 2011</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: The logical operator OR",
            "id": 95901,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Assicurati che la query selezioni gli elementi con un <code>genre</code> uguale a <code>'fiction'</code> oppure con un <code>year</code> uguale a <code>2011</code>.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE books (&#xA; title varchar(255),&#xA; year int,&#xA; genre varchar(255)&#xA;);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO books(title, year, genre)&#xA;VALUES ('Ulysses', 1992, 'fiction');&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO books(title, year, genre)&#xA;VALUES ('Sapiens', 2011, 'non-fiction');&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO books(title, year, genre)&#xA;VALUES ('Beloved', 1987, 'fiction');&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO books(title, year, genre)&#xA;VALUES ('The Prince', 1532, 'non-fiction');\"><tables><table name=\"books\"><row><header content=\"title\" /><header content=\"year\" /><header content=\"genre\" /></row><row><data content=\"Ulysses\" /><data content=\"1992\" /><data content=\"fiction\" /></row><row><data content=\"Sapiens\" /><data content=\"2011\" /><data content=\"non-fiction\" /></row><row><data content=\"Beloved\" /><data content=\"1987\" /><data content=\"fiction\" /></row><row><data content=\"The Prince\" /><data content=\"1532\" /><data content=\"non-fiction\" /></row></table></tables></database><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" books\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" genre = \" /><text value=\"'fiction'\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"OR\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" = \" /><text value=\"2011\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"59\" /></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><header content=\"title\" /><header content=\"year\" /><header content=\"genre\" /></row><row><data content=\"Ulysses\" /><data content=\"1992\" /><data content=\"fiction\" /></row><row><data content=\"Sapiens\" /><data content=\"2011\" /><data content=\"non-fiction\" /></row><row><data content=\"Beloved\" /><data content=\"1987\" /><data content=\"fiction\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>OR year = 2011</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: IN, BETWEEN, or LIKE",
            "id": 95904,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa seleziona questa query?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" books\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" title \" /><text value=\"LIKE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'%a%'\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"OR\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"BETWEEN\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"1950\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"AND\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"2020\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Elementi con un <code>title</code> contenente <code>a</code> oppure con <code>year</code> compreso tra <code>1950</code> e <code>2020</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Elementi con un <code>title</code> contenente <code>a</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Elementi con un <code>year</code> compreso tra <code>1950</code> e <code>2020</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Elementi con un <code>title</code> contenente <code>a</code> oppure con <code>year</code> compreso tra <code>1950</code> e <code>2020</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le condizioni unite con <code>OR</code> selezionano una riga quando almeno una condizione è vera.</p><p>Un titolo non contiene <code>a</code>, ma l'anno è 2000. La query mostrata lo seleziona?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" books\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" title \" /><text value=\"LIKE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'%a%'\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"OR\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"BETWEEN\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"1950\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"AND\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"2020\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sì, il suo anno rientra nell'intervallo BETWEEN</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">No, il suo titolo non corrisponde a LIKE</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">No, entrambe le condizioni OR devono essere vere</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sì, il suo anno rientra nell'intervallo BETWEEN.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Same as IN 2",
            "id": 95907,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Queste due query sono equivalenti?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" books\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"IN\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"1950\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2020\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" books\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" = \" /><text value=\"1950\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"OR\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" = \" /><text value=\"2020\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sì, selezionano entrambi gli elementi con un <code>year</code> pari a <code>1950</code> o <code>2020</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">No, <code>IN</code> non ha equivalenti</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">No, non possiamo usare <code>OR</code> per concatenare le condizioni</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sì, selezionano entrambi gli elementi con un <code>year</code> pari a <code>1950</code> o <code>2020</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>L'anno di un libro è 1960. Una delle due query mostrate lo seleziona?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" books\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"IN\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"1950\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2020\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" books\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" = \" /><text value=\"1950\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"OR\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" = \" /><text value=\"2020\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">No, nessuna delle due query include il 1960</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sì, IN include ogni anno tra il 1950 e il 2020</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Sì, OR include qualsiasi anno</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">No, nessuna delle due query include il 1960.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: IN, BETWEEN, or LIKE",
            "id": 95906,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Collega una condizione con <code>'%a%'</code> per selezionare anche gli elementi con un <code>title</code> che contiene la lettera <code>a</code>.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE books (&#xA; title varchar(255),&#xA; year int,&#xA; genre varchar(255)&#xA;);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO books(title, year, genre)&#xA;VALUES ('Ulysses', 1992, 'fiction');&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO books(title, year, genre)&#xA;VALUES ('Sapiens', 2011, 'non-fiction');&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO books(title, year, genre)&#xA;VALUES ('Beloved', 1987, 'fiction');&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO books(title, year, genre)&#xA;VALUES ('The Prince', 1532, 'non-fiction');\"><tables><table name=\"books\"><row><header content=\"title\" /><header content=\"year\" /><header content=\"genre\" /></row><row><data content=\"Ulysses\" /><data content=\"1992\" /><data content=\"fiction\" /></row><row><data content=\"Sapiens\" /><data content=\"2011\" /><data content=\"non-fiction\" /></row><row><data content=\"Beloved\" /><data content=\"1987\" /><data content=\"fiction\" /></row><row><data content=\"The Prince\" /><data content=\"1532\" /><data content=\"non-fiction\" /></row></table></tables></database><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" books\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" title \" /><text value=\"LIKE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'%a%'\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"OR\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"BETWEEN\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"1950\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"AND\" class=\"keyword\" /><tex